C neyvia.documents.check blocks: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).blocks==true
C neyvia.documents.check references: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).references==true
C neyvia.documents.check overfull: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).overfull==true
C neyvia.documents.check inter-embedded: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).interEmbedded==true
C neyvia.documents.check blocks: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).blocks==true
C neyvia.documents.check pages: neyvia.documents.check(path:path).pages==true
