-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"goal":"Create a document from Paul's template, build it, check every outcome and render pages to look at","inputs":{"$cl_type":"t8"},"steps":[{"action":"documents.create","args":{"chapters":{"$input":"chapters"},"path":{"$input":"path"},"title":{"$input":"title"},"variant":{"$input":"variant"}},"save":"created"},{"action":"documents.build","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"compiles","save":"built"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"blocks","save":"checked"},{"action":"documents.render","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"save":"pages"},{"action":"documents.glance","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"save":"glance"},{"judge":"pages-look-right"}]},"key":"new-document","section":"procedures"}
P new-document(path:str#1.. variant:json:"{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"course\",\"sheet\"]}" title:str#1.. chapters:[str#1..]#1..40):created=neyvia.documents.create(chapters:chapters path:path title:title variant:variant); built=neyvia.documents.build(path:path) C compiles; checked=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C blocks; pages=neyvia.documents.render(path:path); glance=neyvia.documents.glance(path:path); J pages-look-right -- Create a document from Paul's template, build it, check every outcome and render pages to look at
V P new-document -> script why:"typed manual runner; stops at every judgement"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"goal":"Rebuild an edited document and prove it still compiles cleanly with every concept in block order","inputs":{"$cl_type":"t2"},"steps":[{"action":"documents.build","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"compiles","save":"built"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"references","save":"checked"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"overfull","save":"layout"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"inter-embedded","save":"fonts"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"blocks","save":"concepts"},{"action":"documents.check","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"check":"pages","save":"length"},{"action":"documents.render","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"save":"pages"},{"action":"documents.glance","args":{"path":{"$input":"path"}},"save":"glance"},{"judge":"pages-look-right"}]},"key":"build-and-check","section":"procedures"}
P build-and-check(path:str#1..):built=neyvia.documents.build(path:path) C compiles; checked=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C references; layout=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C overfull; fonts=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C inter-embedded; concepts=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C blocks; length=neyvia.documents.check(path:path) C pages; pages=neyvia.documents.render(path:path); glance=neyvia.documents.glance(path:path); J pages-look-right -- Rebuild an edited document and prove it still compiles cleanly with every concept in block order
V P build-and-check -> script why:"typed manual runner; stops at every judgement"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"constraints":"The pluggable LAYA page glance (documents.glance) answers this once attached; until then a person looks at the PNGs from documents.render. A missing judge is never a pass.","kind":"human","options":["looks-fine","looks-broken"],"question":"Do the rendered pages look right: no clipped boxes, overlapping text, empty or half-empty pages?"},"key":"pages-look-right","section":"judge"}
J pages-look-right looks-fine|looks-broken:"Do the rendered pages look right: no clipped boxes, overlapping text, empty or half-empty pages?" -- The pluggable LAYA page glance (documents.glance) answers this once attached; until then a person looks at the PNGs from documents.render. A missing judge is never a pass.
V J pages-look-right -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Tectonic is missing","recovery":"Run python scripts/study_docs.py setup --install: it fetches the official GitHub release (about 21 MB) to D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/bin."},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Tectonic is missing -> Run python scripts/study_docs.py setup --install: it fetches the official GitHub release (about 21 MB) to D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/bin.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"A package is not in the cache","recovery":"documents.build retries online once and Tectonic fetches only that package into D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/cache; later builds run offline."},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X A package is not in the cache -> documents.build retries online once and Tectonic fetches only that package into D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/cache; later builds run offline.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Inter is not embedded","recovery":"The class loads Inter by file name from templates/latex/neyvia-study/fonts, which the build puts on the search path; elsewhere set \\studyfontpath{dir/}."},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Inter is not embedded -> The class loads Inter by file name from templates/latex/neyvia-study/fonts, which the build puts on the search path; elsewhere set \studyfontpath{dir/}.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Overfull box over 1 pt","recovery":"Split the long formula over several \\step or \\dline lines, one transformation per line; never shrink the font."},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Overfull box over 1 pt -> Split the long formula over several \step or \dline lines, one transformation per line; never shrink the font.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Blocks out of order or a concept without a tag","recovery":"Reorder to definition, method, reflex, worked, traps, practice and give \\begin{concept}{title}{tag} the source page and column."},"key":"4","section":"pitfalls"}
X Blocks out of order or a concept without a tag -> Reorder to definition, method, reflex, worked, traps, practice and give \begin{concept}{title}{tag} the source page and column.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Undefined reference","recovery":"Fix the \\ref label; a second build pass never hides a missing label."},"key":"5","section":"pitfalls"}
X Undefined reference -> Fix the \ref label; a second build pass never hides a missing label.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":"The LAYA page glance is a pluggable step: documents.glance hands the page PNGs to the command in NEYVIA_LAYA_GLANCE and reports not available until another component attaches it.","key":"0","section":"frontier"}
F The LAYA page glance is a pluggable step: documents.glance hands the page PNGs to the command in NEYVIA_LAYA_GLANCE and reports not available until another component attaches it.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":"The six-part format is the same structure Scroll Study card packs use (paul-seven-part.v1): definition = FORMULA with WHEN?, method = WHAT DO I WRITE?, reflex = PATTERN, worked = COURSE EXAMPLE, practice = YOUR EXERCISE, traps = VARIATIONS/TRAPS. One source can feed both; the converter is not built yet.","key":"1","section":"frontier"}
F The six-part format is the same structure Scroll Study card packs use (paul-seven-part.v1): definition = FORMULA with WHEN?, method = WHAT DO I WRITE?, reflex = PATTERN, worked = COURSE EXAMPLE, practice = YOUR EXERCISE, traps = VARIATIONS/TRAPS. One source can feed both; the converter is not built yet.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":"Paul's own Complete Course has concepts with no method (19 of 199) or no worked example (41 of 199), so the block check requires definition and reflex and reports the others; require 1234 makes it strict.","key":"2","section":"frontier"}
F Paul's own Complete Course has concepts with no method (19 of 199) or no worked example (41 of 199), so the block check requires definition and reflex and reports the others; require 1234 makes it strict.
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":"Ports of chapter 1 of the Complete Course and the Formula & Method Sheet onto the class place all 58 concept headings at the original page and position; scripts/study_docs.py port and compare reproduce it.","key":"3","section":"frontier"}
F Ports of chapter 1 of the Complete Course and the Formula & Method Sheet onto the class place all 58 concept headings at the original page and position; scripts/study_docs.py port and compare reproduce it.
